#: Sidralune/Views/AstrometryView.cs
msgid "The internal solver matches triangles of stars (scale and rotation invariant) against catalogue stars, then fits a TAN-SIP world coordinate system. Without hints it tries field sizes from 0.25° to 60°. Gaia DR3 queries are cached for offline re-use."
