#: Sidralune/Views/SettingsView.cs
msgid "Images are shown through the monitor's profile, which Windows provides. Files without a profile (FITS, raw frames, stacks) are taken to be in the working profile. 8-bit files in a wide profile such as ProPhoto RGB look dull in programs without colour management and can show banding; convert them to sRGB for the web. Night vision mode shows only brightness, so colour management does not apply there."
